An uncursed has the same effect as a blessed one unless you bumble
into negative Luck. But then, you can just stow it away. It helps to
know what you're doing and how it affects Luck. In consequence, you
don't need to bless your luckstone until you meet spellcasters. Even
then, you can stackability-test with a second one in a bag to see if
it's cursed, and swap accordingly.

BTW, you can greatly reduce the risk of getting good stuff cursed or
stolen by carrying lots of individually named gems, darts, arrows...
as curse-catchers.

